      "passageHtml": "<div class=\"passage-box email-format\">\n<p><strong>To:</strong> Kenji Sato &lt;k.sato@harborviewhotel.com&gt;<br>\n<strong>From:</strong> Clara Evans &lt;c.evans@evansevents.com&gt;<br>\n<strong>Date:</strong> August 12<br>\n<strong>Subject:</strong> Catering and AV requirements for the Apex Summit</p>\n<hr>\n<p>Dear Mr. Sato,</p>\n<p>I am writing to finalize our booking arrangements for the Apex Technology Summit scheduled for September 24 in the Grand Pavilion at Harborview Hotel.</p>\n<p>After reviewing our latest attendee registrations, we anticipate approximately 140 participants. Consequently, we would like to adjust the luncheon catering order from the standard buffet to the three-course seated banquet. In addition, could you please confirm whether the conference hall includes high-definition projectors and wireless microphones, or if we need to reserve those through an external audiovisual vendor?</p>\n<p>Please send us an updated price estimate reflecting these adjustments by Thursday so that our finance committee can process the deposit.</p>\n<p>Best regards,</p>\n<p>Clara Evans<br>\nLead Event Coordinator, Evans Event Management</p>\n</div>",
