      "passageHtml": "<div class=\"passage-box job-format\">\n<p style=\"font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:bold; color:#2b6cb0;\">ORION GLOBAL LOGISTICS — CAREER OPPORTUNITY</p>\n<p><strong>Position:</strong> Senior Supply Chain Analyst<br>\n<strong>Location:</strong> Chicago, IL (Hybrid — 3 days on-site, 2 days remote)<br>\n<strong>Department:</strong> Global Freight Operations</p>\n<p><strong>Key Responsibilities:</strong><br>\n• Analyze cross-border freight routes to optimize fuel efficiency and transit timelines.<br>\n• Supervise data integration from overseas maritime carriers.<br>\n• Prepare quarterly operational performance dashboards for executive management.</p>\n<p><strong>Qualifications Required:</strong><br>\n• Bachelor’s degree in Logistics, Data Analytics, or related field.<br>\n• Minimum of 5 years of commercial logistics data modeling experience.<br>\n• Proven proficiency with enterprise SQL database management and Tableau visualization software.<br>\n• Fluency in English; working proficiency in Spanish or Mandarin is advantageous.</p>\n<p>Interested candidates should submit a cover letter, résumé, and two professional references to careers@orionlogistics.com by June 30.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"passage-box letter-format\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\">\n<p>Carlos Gutierrez<br>\n448 Maple Boulevard, Apt 3B<br>\nChicago, IL 60614<br>\nJune 24</p>\n<p>Hiring Committee, Orion Global Logistics<br>\n100 Michigan Avenue, Suite 1400<br>\nChicago, IL 60601</p>\n<p>Dear Members of the Hiring Committee,</p>\n<p>I am writing to express my enthusiastic interest in the Senior Supply Chain Analyst position posted on your career portal. Having worked as a Logistics Operations Analyst at Midwest Cargo Systems for the past six years, I have developed extensive expertise in maritime data analysis and automated route optimization.</p>\n<p>In my current position, I engineered a predictive inventory and shipping dashboard utilizing SQL and Tableau that reduced shipping delays by 18% across our South American distribution corridors. Furthermore, having grown up bilingually in Mexico and the United States, I possess native fluency in both English and Spanish, which has allowed me to negotiate directly with Latin American customs officials and terminal operators.</p>\n<p>Attached are my résumé and references as requested. I look forward to discussing how my analytical background aligns with Orion’s strategic goals.</p>\n<p>Sincerely,</p>\n<p>Carlos Gutierrez</p>\n</div>",
