      "passageHtml": "<div class=\"passage-box web-format\">\n<p style=\"font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:bold; color:#1a365d;\">PAN-PACIFIC RETAIL INNOVATION SUMMIT (OCTOBER 18)</p>\n<p><strong>Venue:</strong> Metroplex Exhibition Center, Seattle, WA</p>\n<p>The annual Pan-Pacific Retail Innovation Summit brings together over 800 retail executives, supply chain strategists, and digital commerce pioneers. This year's focus is on integrating artificial intelligence into customer retention workflows and sustainable packaging practices.</p>\n<p>All registered attendees are welcome to attend morning keynote addresses in the Main Auditorium, followed by specialized afternoon breakout sessions. Complimentary lunch and coffee will be served in the Courtyard Terrace.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"passage-box schedule-format\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">\n<p style=\"font-weight:bold; margin-bottom:6px;\">AFTERNOON BREAKOUT SESSIONS (1:30 P.M. – 3:00 P.M.)</p>\n<table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:0.88rem;\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"background:#edf2f7; border-bottom:2px solid #cbd5e0;\">\n<th style=\"padding:5px; text-align:left;\">Session Title</th>\n<th style=\"padding:5px; text-align:left;\">Room</th>\n<th style=\"padding:5px; text-align:left;\">Featured Speaker</th>\n<th style=\"padding:5px; text-align:left;\">Organization</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n<td style=\"padding:5px;\">A: Predictive Inventory Management</td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px;\">Cedar Room</td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px;\">Dr. Aris Thorne</td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px;\">NextGen Logistics</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n<td style=\"padding:5px;\">B: AI-Driven Personalization Strategies</td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px;\">Birch Hall</td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px;\">Yuki Takahashi</td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px;\">OmniCommerce Solutions</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n<td style=\"padding:5px;\">C: Eco-Friendly Supply Chain Packaging</td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px;\">Maple Suite</td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px;\">Rachel Dupont</td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px;\">GreenLeaf Materials</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n<td style=\"padding:5px;\">D: Modern In-Store Cashless Checkout</td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px;\">Oak Room</td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px;\">Marcus Zhao</td>\n<td style=\"padding:5px;\">Pacific Pay Systems</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"passage-box feedback-format\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">\n<p style=\"font-weight:bold; font-size:0.95rem;\">SUMMIT EVALUATION & FEEDBACK</p>\n<p><strong>Attendee Name:</strong> Bradley Cooper, VP of Merchandising, Cascade Retailers<br>\n<strong>Overall Rating:</strong> 4 out of 5 Stars<br>\n<strong>Comments:</strong><br>\n\"Overall, the event was exceptionally well-organized and packed with actionable insights. The morning keynote delivered by the summit chairs was inspiring, and the lunch catering was top-tier.</p>\n<p>In the afternoon, I attended the session hosted by OmniCommerce Solutions. The live case studies detailing automated email engagement algorithms were the highlight of my day! However, Birch Hall was far too small for the crowd—many of us had to stand at the back for over an hour. For next year, please assign larger rooms to presentations addressing artificial intelligence.\"</p>\n</div>",
